  npcName: Dr. Vance
  dialogueLines:
  - This wing houses our Flip-Clock Turret! Every time you press [F], the turret
    steps 90 degrees clockwise.
  - Aim it into the Relay Crystal to split power to both sensors and drop the Forcefield!
